            "partyGoals": [
              "Become part of Bramblebridge without taking over its life.",
              "Learn who profits from the new toll orders and why an empty tax wagon reached the market.",
              "Choose how powerful systems can be made humane without making every victory belong to one conspiracy."
            ],
            "toneAndBoundaries": [
              "Cozy, lightly humorous, storybook medieval adventure grounded in believable work, law, travel, weather, and consequence.",
